   "fieldtype": "Link",
   "label": "Endorsement Settlement Account",
   "options": "Account",
   "description": "Receivable only: optional GL account debited on Registered → Endorsement (claim / endorsed-to settlement). Overrides PDC Settings “Default Endorsement Account”. No party on this line. If unset, builder may debit the endorsed holder’s receivable instead (see developer guide)."
  },
